**Situational skills:** @.cursor/rules/back_developer/skills-gate-situational.mdc
**Policy lazy (по триггеру, не грузить целиком):** @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc · @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-legacy-fallback-cleanup.mdc · @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-spec-first-replace.mdc
